WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:05.200
If you look at the At-Turaif urban fabric,
you can see the small alleys.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.600
You can see the compacted buildings.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.300
You can see that all the buildings
were built using local materials,

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.100
like mud brick and athel wood,

5
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.500
sourced within the same region,
the same environment.

6
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.600
The Najdi urban fabric
is sustainable by nature.

7
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.000
In simple words, Najdi architecture
is the soul of the development.
